// ReShade/GShade looks: runs the player's ReShade or GShade preset (.ini) inside Apex's post-scene chain.
// The shaders are ported from the ReShade/GShade .fx files with the same maths (features/gshade/, generated by
// tools/gen_gshade_shaders.py). Values come straight from the .ini.
// Small and isolated on purpose: one file plus three one-line hookups (vcxproj, Color page tab, profile part).

